WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.033 --> 00:00:02.167
-I can't wait to talk to you.

00:00:02.167 --> 00:00:03.701
Thank you so much
for being on our show.

00:00:03.701 --> 00:00:04.834
-Thank you for having me.

00:00:04.834 --> 00:00:08.534
-This is your first-ever
Las Vegas residency,

00:00:08.534 --> 00:00:09.634
which is kind of
hard to believe,

00:00:09.634 --> 00:00:10.634
but it's your first ever.

00:00:10.634 --> 00:00:13.868
It's kicking off in two weeks.

00:00:13.868 --> 00:00:16.767
You showed me some
rehearsal footage backstage.

00:00:16.767 --> 00:00:18.334
It is -- It's insane.

00:00:18.334 --> 00:00:20.667
I don't know how --
It's not even a magic show.

00:00:20.667 --> 00:00:23.667
It's -- I don't know how
to describe what you showed me.

00:00:23.667 --> 00:00:26.667
It's like -- Trust me.
Get there and do it.

00:00:26.667 --> 00:00:27.801
You will experience this.

00:00:27.801 --> 00:00:29.434
I mean, what do we --
How do you even --

00:00:29.434 --> 00:00:31.968
-Maybe we try something with
all of you guys?

00:00:31.968 --> 00:00:35.834
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:35.834 --> 00:00:38.067
Yeah, let's try something
with everybody.

00:00:38.067 --> 00:00:42.534
-Already? Already?
What are you doing already?

00:00:42.534 --> 00:00:46.434
-Everybody, I think you all have
an envelope under your seats.

00:00:46.434 --> 00:00:47.934
You do, too.

00:00:47.934 --> 00:00:49.767
There's an envelope
under your seats.

00:00:49.767 --> 00:00:52.968
It should be --
And it says, "Do not open."

00:00:52.968 --> 00:00:56.634
Everybody hold that envelope up.
You all have -- Good, great.

00:00:56.634 --> 00:01:00.701
Just rip it open, and there's
a deck of cards in the envelope.

00:01:00.701 --> 00:01:01.868
Everybody open the box

00:01:01.868 --> 00:01:05.033
and pour all of the cards
into your hand.

00:01:05.033 --> 00:01:08.701
Make sure they don't spill.
And turn it face-down.

00:01:08.701 --> 00:01:10.267
Good. The box is empty? Great.

00:01:10.267 --> 00:01:13.634
Put the box on the floor.
You don't need it.

00:01:13.634 --> 00:01:16.601
Turn all the cards face-down.
-Yeah.

00:01:16.601 --> 00:01:18.701
-Hold it in your hand
just like that.

00:01:18.701 --> 00:01:19.868
Perfect. Great.

00:01:19.868 --> 00:01:22.167
Is everybody
holding the deck face-down?

00:01:23.667 --> 00:01:27.033
Okay, I want everybody to just
pick up a bunch of cards.

00:01:27.033 --> 00:01:28.300
And everybody show us --

00:01:28.300 --> 00:01:30.968
Everybody show the card that you
cut to, so turn it over.

00:01:30.968 --> 00:01:32.968
-Can I show it?
-Yeah, turn it over. Great.

00:01:32.968 --> 00:01:35.234
Did you all do that,
just like Jimmy?

00:01:35.234 --> 00:01:37.767
Leave that file face-up
and put it on top of the pile

00:01:37.767 --> 00:01:39.267
in your hand with --
Just like that.

00:01:39.267 --> 00:01:42.467
So, spread through the face-up
cards to the last face-up card.

00:01:42.467 --> 00:01:43.701
Go ahead, spread through.

00:01:43.701 --> 00:01:45.033
And you'll see
they're all different,

00:01:45.033 --> 00:01:48.467
until you see the first
face-down card, just like Jimmy.

00:01:48.467 --> 00:01:51.100
And put the face-up pile
on the bottom now.

00:01:51.100 --> 00:01:52.567
Everybody
put them on the bottom.

00:01:52.567 --> 00:01:54.801
Yeah, just like that. Perfect.
And watch they don't spill.

00:01:54.801 --> 00:01:56.267
They're a little slippery.

00:01:56.267 --> 00:01:58.033
Okay, so, we're going to
take five cards.

00:01:58.033 --> 00:02:02.601
So count five cards.
One, two, three, four, five.

00:02:02.601 --> 00:02:04.234
Yep, take five cards. Good.

00:02:04.234 --> 00:02:05.767
Is -- Everybody has five cards?

00:02:05.767 --> 00:02:07.701
Which is like a poker --
And leave them face-down

00:02:07.701 --> 00:02:09.667
in your hands, everybody.

00:02:09.667 --> 00:02:10.968
And get rid of the big pile.

00:02:10.968 --> 00:02:13.167
Throw it on the floor,
whatever you want.

00:02:15.167 --> 00:02:17.868
-Big cleanup here tonight.
-Great.

00:02:17.868 --> 00:02:20.934
Okay, now choose anybody
in the audience at random.

00:02:20.934 --> 00:02:22.801
I don't care.
Just call somebody out.

00:02:22.801 --> 00:02:24.734
It's up to you. You choose.

00:02:24.734 --> 00:02:27.634
-Alright, I will
say that guy over there

00:02:27.634 --> 00:02:30.200
with the striped shirt
right there with the blond hair.

00:02:30.200 --> 00:02:32.167
-Oh, great. Could you stand up?
-Yes.

00:02:32.167 --> 00:02:35.367
-So, pick a number
between 1 and 5.

00:02:35.367 --> 00:02:37.133
Say it out loud.

00:02:37.133 --> 00:02:38.767
-4.
-4?

00:02:38.767 --> 00:02:42.200
Everybody take the fourth card
and hide it in your pocket.

00:02:42.200 --> 00:02:44.467
So, count, face-down,
1, 2, 3, 4.

00:02:44.467 --> 00:02:47.133
And take the fourth card
and hide it in your pocket.

00:02:47.133 --> 00:02:48.534
Don't let anybody see it.

00:02:48.534 --> 00:02:50.534
Or sit on it
if you don't have pockets.

00:02:50.534 --> 00:02:52.167
Everybody hide the card.

00:02:52.167 --> 00:02:54.968
Everybody did that?
-Yes.

00:02:54.968 --> 00:02:56.434
-Okay, get rid of
the other cards.

00:02:56.434 --> 00:02:58.400
Get rid of all the other cards.
We don't need them.

00:02:58.400 --> 00:02:59.467
Everybody drop them
on the floor.

00:02:59.467 --> 00:03:00.634
-Floor, yeah, exactly.

00:03:00.634 --> 00:03:02.701
Oh, my God.
Yeah, it's unbelievable.

00:03:02.701 --> 00:03:06.634
-Now, now, Jimmy --

00:03:06.634 --> 00:03:09.567
-It's great to
see you, buddy, yeah.

00:03:09.567 --> 00:03:12.133
-Jimmy, we brought some pins.

00:03:12.133 --> 00:03:13.334
-Mm-hmm.
-There's pins.

00:03:13.334 --> 00:03:14.801
Could you grab
these little pins right here?

00:03:14.801 --> 00:03:16.601
Yeah. Yeah, yeah.
-Okay.

00:03:16.601 --> 00:03:18.701
-This is going to be fun.

00:03:20.968 --> 00:03:23.334
-What are you doing to me, bud?

00:03:23.334 --> 00:03:25.334
-I don't know.
And -- I don't know.

00:03:25.334 --> 00:03:27.033
Can you look at them
and make sure they're real pins?

00:03:27.033 --> 00:03:28.868
Don't hurt yourself.
Don't, like, snap one.

00:03:28.868 --> 00:03:31.400
-Yeah. Okay. Yeah, this is --
-Yeah? It's a real pin?

00:03:31.400 --> 00:03:33.267
-These are pins.
-And they're sharp.

00:03:33.267 --> 00:03:34.734
-Yes, yes.

00:03:34.734 --> 00:03:36.167
I know, Questlove.
Don't freak out.

00:03:36.167 --> 00:03:39.234
Yeah.
Yes, these are sharp pins.

00:03:39.234 --> 00:03:40.801
-Can you pull one
of the pins out?

00:03:40.801 --> 00:03:42.734
