do anything to you, David.

00:03:44.367 --> 00:03:46.267
'Cause I honestly --
I love having you on the show.

00:03:46.267 --> 00:03:47.267
I don't like hurting you.

00:03:47.267 --> 00:03:49.501
-And can you --

00:03:49.501 --> 00:03:52.234
Let's see if we can do it on
your desk, actually, here.

00:03:52.234 --> 00:03:55.567
So, I'm going to try to
stick this in.

00:03:55.567 --> 00:03:56.667
No, you know what?

00:03:56.667 --> 00:03:59.267
Can you hand me
the deck of cards?

00:03:59.267 --> 00:04:02.767
Great.
So, let's do like this here.

00:04:02.767 --> 00:04:07.634
I'm going to use the -- And you
see all the cards in the deck.

00:04:07.634 --> 00:04:09.234
So, we'll use -- Here.

00:04:09.234 --> 00:04:12.033
We'll use maybe the joker card
