00:04:12.033 --> 00:04:14.200
So, here.
We'll use this card, the joker.

00:04:14.200 --> 00:04:15.367
-Okay.

00:04:15.367 --> 00:04:18.067
-So, we use the joker,
and I'm going to bend it

00:04:18.067 --> 00:04:20.434
