the card like that.

00:04:27.067 --> 00:04:29.300
Now it'll stick.

00:04:29.300 --> 00:04:31.234
You see that?
-Okay.

00:04:31.234 --> 00:04:33.701
-So, the pin is definitely
sticking into the card.

00:04:33.701 --> 00:04:35.567
Jimmy, hold your hand like this.

00:04:35.567 --> 00:04:36.767
No, you're not going to
do anything.

00:04:36.767 --> 00:04:38.567
Yeah, yeah, your other hand,
the right hand.

00:04:38.567 --> 00:04:40.567
Open -- Yeah, yeah.
Open, open, open.

00:04:40.567 --> 00:04:43.033
Good. Make it -- Yeah.

00:04:43.033 --> 00:04:44.968
And just feel gently.
Feel it.

00:04:44.968 --> 00:04:47.000
Is that really a sharp pin?

00:04:47.000 --> 00:04:48.834
Gently, gently.

00:04:48.834 --> 00:04:49.868
It's really there?
-Yes.

00:04:49.868 --> 00:04:51.067
-It's sharp?
-Yes.

00:04:51.067 --> 00:04:52.300
-Yes?
-Yes.

00:04:52.300 --> 00:04:53.667
-Okay, good.

00:04:53.667 --> 00:04:57.868
So, Jimmy,
what we're going to do is,

00:04:57.868 --> 00:04:59.167
