you like this.

00:05:09.033 --> 00:05:10.234
-Oh, my gosh.
-Let's do it together.

00:05:10.234 --> 00:05:11.567
Look. One, two, three.

00:05:11.567 --> 00:05:13.767
-I've had,
like, hand injuries, David.

00:05:13.767 --> 00:05:15.267
Please, please. I've had --

00:05:15.267 --> 00:05:17.033
-Hold on.
We're going to do it like this.

00:05:17.033 --> 00:05:20.133
Look. 1, 2, 3,
and we're gonna slam,

00:05:20.133 --> 00:05:21.267
