00:05:21.267 --> 00:05:23.234
-Aah-ha, David! No!

00:05:23.234 --> 00:05:24.701
-We're going to go together.
Ready?

00:05:24.701 --> 00:05:27.367
-No, please, please, please.
-One, two...

00:05:27.367 --> 00:05:29.434
No, I'm just kidding.
-My gosh!

00:05:29.434 --> 00:05:31.801
-Aah!
♪♪

00:05:31.801 --> 00:05:34.033
-I can't do it. I can't.

00:05:35.734 --> 00:05:37.400
Gosh!

00:05:37.400 --> 00:05:39.300
-Jimmy, come back.
-You freak me out!

00:05:39.300 --> 00:05:40.534
