00:05:40.534 --> 00:05:42.033
-No, no,
I wouldn't make you do that.

00:05:42.033 --> 00:05:44.000
-Don't make me do that, please!

00:05:44.000 --> 00:05:45.133
Oh, my gosh.

00:05:45.133 --> 00:05:47.367
-Jimmy, before we do that --
-Yes! What?!

00:05:47.367 --> 00:05:49.701
-Jimmy, before we do that,
